sequenceDiagram
    participant OS as Os.cpp / Task_10ms
    participant SchM as SchM_Rte.cpp
    participant Sensor as SensorInputSWC
    participant RTE as RTE API / Rte.cpp
    participant Tracker as ObjectTrackerSWC
    participant DEM as Dem.cpp
    participant NvM as NvM.cpp
    participant DCM as Dcm.cpp

    Note over Sensor,Tracker: Phase 1 initial end-to-end execution concept

    OS->>SchM: Activate 10 ms cycle
    SchM->>Sensor: SensorInput_MainCycle()
    Sensor->>RTE: Rte_Write_ObjectCandidateList(list)

    SchM->>Tracker: ObjectTracker_MainCycle()
    Tracker->>RTE: Rte_Read_ObjectCandidateList(&list)
    RTE-->>Tracker: ObjectCandidateList_T

    Tracker->>Tracker: Evaluate candidates O(n)

    alt Invalid or timeout sensor quality
        Tracker->>RTE: Rte_Call_ReportDiagnosticEvent(...)
        RTE->>DEM: Report InvalidSensorQualityEvent
    end

    alt Candidate rejected
        Tracker->>RTE: Rte_Call_UpdateDiagnosticCounter(...)
        RTE->>NvM: Update FalsePositiveCounter
    end

    Tracker->>RTE: Rte_Write_TrackedObjectStatus(status)
    Tracker->>RTE: Rte_Write_ObjectAlertOutput(alert)

    DCM->>RTE: Diagnostic read request DID 0xD100
    RTE->>Tracker: ObjectTracker_DiagnosticRead()
    Tracker-->>RTE: Tracking status / counters
    RTE-->>DCM: Diagnostic response data
